name 'pl_sandbox_embed-flowchart-drag'
title 'title'
description 'description here'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
This widget was created for Unit 3 to help teachers see where the code connects to the flowchart. It would be used after creating a flowchart in sketch lab but before working with code in web lab.  


<div style="width:100%; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(108,99,255,0.15);">
  <iframe 
    src="https://amandadennard-dotcom.github.io/Flowchart-dragdrop-iframe/flowchart_dragdrop_iframe.html"
    width="100%"
    height="780"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="pointer-events">
  </iframe>
</div>













MARKDOWN
